Inspiration from GoPro Athlete Josh Daiek 🫡 Upload this season's raw, ski + snowboard POVs from any GoPro to GoPro.com/LineOfTheWinter to enter—there are categories for men + women with $120,000 on the line. 16 clips will score $5,000 each, 4 more will go on to take home the title + an additional $10,000.

@goprosnow #GoPro #Ski #Snowboard #POV #GoProPOV

Keywords: Skiing, Snowboarding, Skier, Snowboarder, Contest, Competition

Welcome to the dark side, GoPro Awards recipient Eivind Aanensen 🌌 The #GoProLineOfTheWinter is officially underway. Submit your ski + snowboard POV’s from this season for the opportunity to be 1 of 16 clips that share the $120,000 pot + have the opportunity to be crowned Line of the Winter ❄️ Did you know there are categories for men + women this year?

@goprosnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #Skiing #POV

Keywords: Skiing, Snowboarding, Skier, Snowboarder, Contest, Competition

Tatsu Yamagishi captured Kaito Hamada's unusually-steezy 1620 rotation on GoPro HERO13 Black + earned $500 for submitting the footage to GoPro.com/Awards.

@goprosnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #Snowboarding #BirAir #SloMo

