No lift ticket, no problem 🤝 $500 GoPro Awards recipient Pierre Vaultier turned his home into a snow park fit for a king + captured his creation on our 360° camera GoPro MAX. This is what dreams are made of.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #GoProPOV #POV #Snowboarding #Snowboarder #Powder

