You may not stick every landing, but your GoPro sure will 📷 Just ask $500 GoPro Awards recipient Mat Cox. His Revelstoke snowbiking powder ride ended in a successful search + rescue mission after he lost his helmet + camera to backcountry.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #GoProBike #Crash #Fail #Powder

