Looking for GoPro Line of the Winter inspiration? Search no further than American freerider, 6-time Skier of the Year, 4-time X Games gold medalist, and GoPro Athlete @SammyCarlsonSki. Submit your own POV clips to the #GoProLineOfTheWinter Challenge via the GoPro Quik app for a chance at scoring a piece of the $120K prize 🏆

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #GoProAwards #Ski #Skiing

Keywords: Skiing, Ski Movie, Powder

If you're looking for GoPro Athlete Elena Hight, this is where you'll find her 🫡 The American Olympic snowboarder spends her winters in the Alaskan backcountry, shredding powder others could only dream of.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #Snowboarding #Snow #POV

Keywords: Snowboard, Snowboarding, Winter

And that's why it's called Japow 🤿 Motoki Hoshino grabbed his skis + snorkel for this unforgettable run in Nagano, Japan that scored him a $500 GoPro Snow Award. 👉 GoPro.com/Awards.

@GoProSnow #Skiing #Powder #Japan #Japow

