A line that only GoPro Athlete Kai Jones would attempt 🤯 The American freeski legend has been stomping it from a young age and he's not slowing down anytime soon. Captured on GoPro HERO13 Black with the new Ultra Wide Lens Mod.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProSnow #Skiing #POV

Keywords: Winter, Ski, Skiing, Freeskiing

The powder king strikes again 👑 Captured by GoPro Athlete Fabio Studer and GoPro MAX. Our 360° camera unlocks next-level creativity—seamless POVs, impossible-looking selfies, and everything in between.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #Skiing #Snow #Winter

