Full sends only for GoPro Award recipient Jack Kilmain who took the route less traveled down S&S Couloir, neighbor to Corbet's Couloir, in Jackson Hole ⛷️ This insane wall ride POV scored him $500 after submitting to us at GoPro.com/Awards.

@GoProSnow #GoProSnow #GoProAwards #GoProLineOfTheWinter #Skiing #POV #GoProPOV

