Straight heat 🔥 GoPro Awards recipient Josh Turner captured this incredible birds-eye-view of Davide Tomasello with his FPV drone set up. The resulting footage of the unique descent alongside Mount Etna's active lava flow in Sicily, Italy scored him $500.

@GoProSnow #GoPro #GoProFPV #Volcano #Skiing

