The only appropriate reaction to @ropeswingmoab 🗣️ GoPro Athlete Reed Boggs strapped on his GoPro MAX and hucked it off of Moab's Rope Swing for the adrenaline rush of a lifetime. FPV pilot Ethan Knorr joined him for the jump, capturing every angle with HERO13 Black and his drone.

@Visitutah @discovermoab #GoPro #RopeSwing #Adrenaline #POV

Keywords: POV, Utah, Visit Utah, Adventure, Tourism, Stunt

@KilianBron is making his name known in Nepal 🇳🇵 Over 4,500 meters up, with Annapurna in the background, an endless, dizzyingly steep face, and a majestic arch to finish it off. Captured on our 360° camera GoPro MAX.

