4 wins in a row for GoPro Athlete Jackson Goldstone 🤯 With this run in La Thuile, Italy, he ties Aaron Gwin’s 2012 record of 4 UCI MTB Men’s Elite DH wins in a row. Jackson will shoot for a record 5th in a row next weekend at Pal Arinsal 👀

🎥 Shot on GoPro HERO13 Black Ultra Wide Edition

